  "A visitor from another world, he's a cuddly and adorable owl in the real world. Despite his serious personality and mature way of speaking, his choice of words and sentences seem somewhat peculiar...": "",
  "Ruferu is knowledgeable about Metaverse exploration and serves as a great guide and companion. However, due to the loss of some of his memories, he has a limited understanding of common human knowledge in the real world. For some reason, Ruferu is obsessed with the phenomenon of \"desire.\"": "",
  "In Mementos, Ruferu can transform into a letter carrier vehicle and carry the Phantom Thieves to various locations. Strangely, this vehicle also comes complete with a pair of peculiar horns. According to him, he can transform because \"there is a perception that cute animals can transform into passenger cars in this place,\" but no one knows why.": "",
  "Ruferu is very interested in human \"desires.\" When I awakened my own desires and became a Phantom Thief, Ruferu admired me as a \"truly unpredictable person\" and gave me the Phantom Thief codename of \"Wonder\".": "",
  "Nonaka Ai": "",
  "My name is Ruferu, and my codename is Cattle. Remember that well.": "",
  "I'm sorry, but I'm not really fond of telling my story.\\n...What's wrong? Please don't look so sad. I'll tell you when the time is right.": "",
  "About 『Purpose』": "",
  "My memories are still incomplete. But I know the path to recovery involves stealing the distorted desires of the palace rulers: their \"treasures.\"": "",
  "We're both members of the Phantom Thieves, and we're in business together. Hoo-hoo, I didn't realize your bag would be so comfortable.": "",
