  "She is a second-year female student at Kokatsu High School, in the same class as me. She is an all-around athlete and is popular with both boys and girls in school. She acts on instinct rather than thinking logically, and her grades seem average.": "",
  "In elementary school, Motoha joined the boys' and girls' federation baseball team. Her skills were outstanding enough that she made the \"best nine\".": "",
