  "Character Frame.\\nTomoko Noge's confidant reward. If you break and are born again, the flower of hope blooms.": "",
  "Declare Your Love": "",
  "Character Frame.\\nTomoko Noge's confidant reward. The feeling I want to convey is a girl's foolish love.": "",
  "A student in the 2-D class at Kokatsu High School. She has known Motoha since elementary school and played with her on the youth team as her catcher and batterymate.": "",
  "Compared to Motoha, who is talented, energetic, and outgoing, Tomoko is compassionate and especially observant, which earns her people's trust. Despite this, Tomoko is often insecure, believing herself to be just an ordinary person. She tends to feel down for a long time after a failure.": "",
  "Satomi Akesaka": "",
  "Hello. I'm Tomoko Noge. Nice to meet you.": "",
  "I'm not talented, I'm not good at anything. What should someone like me do? I feel so lost sometimes.": "",
  "About 『Baseball』": "",
  "About 『Motoha Arai』": "",
  "About 『Shun Kanou』": "",
  "Can you come with me today?": "",
  "I want to go somewhere.\\nBut, if you're busy it's okay...": "",
  "How about it?\\nWould you like to spend time with Tomoko?": "",
  "That's fine... Just tell me when you're free.": "",
  "So where are we going~? Any idea?": "",
  "There's a baseball field near this park.": "",
  "When I was in the kids' baseball team, Motoha and I used to walk home together.": "",
  "When I spoke to her today, it made me miss those times.": "",
  "...O-Oh, I didn't come here just to talk about that.": "",
  "There's a snack stall nearby, and I got talking to one of the staff there.": "",
  "I told them I've been trying to work part-time at different places, and they asked if I want to work there too.": "",
  "They said I'd only have to come when it's busy, so I'm thinking of giving it a shot...": "",
  "I've got a lot of memories playing baseball here, so I was hoping it'd clear my mind.": "",
  "I knew it'd be okay if I came with you.": "",
  "Sorry for dragging you here for no reason.": "",
  "In that case...": "",
  "It's okay": "",
  "Okay. Thank you,\\nThat means a lot.": "",
  "...I'm feeling a lot better now. From now on I'm going to do my best.": "",
  "Will you come to visit me whilst I'm working part-time? I might just give you a surprise.": "",
  "I spend time at the park with Tomoko. \\nAfter she finished her part-time job we ate snacks together...": ""
